# Two functions of the Preferences window nothing in the game calls (the scene host's open step reaches them): redraw_option, which
# draws the frame of the options' area, and redraw_volume, which draws the frame of the sliders when the sound page is shown. Each is
# called with the number it reads (a static) moved, so that the frame it draws into the window's picture lies somewhere the window's
# own drawing does not put it, and the number is put back; a tab clicked after shows the stray frame.
